  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Nagaraj vs The Commissioner on 23 January, 2024 Author: V.Bhavani Subbaroyan Bench: V.Bhavani Subbaroyan W.P.(MD)No. BEFORE THE MADURAI BENCH OF MADRAS HIGH COURT DATED : 23.01.2024 CORAM THE HON'BLE MRS JUSTICE V.BHAVANI SUBBAROYAN W.P.(MD)No.1279 of 2024 and W.M.P(MD)Nos.1312 & 1313 of 2024 Nagaraj ... Petitioner Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, 359, Anna Salai, Teynampet, Chennai-6. 2.The Designated Officer, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Wing, st 1 Floor, D.D.H.S.Compound, Viswanathapuram, Madurai-14. 3.The Food Safety Officer, Code No.573, Madurai Corporation, Madurai. 4.The Inspector of Police, Mattuthavani Police Station, Madurai City, Madurai. ... Respondents Nagaraj vs The Commissioner on 23 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/193020363/ 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/4 W.P Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of India, Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus, to call for the records pertaining to the i Order passed by the 2nd respondent herein in Na.Ka.No.2845/m2/2023/c.gh.m da 23.12.2023 to quash the same as unconstitutional and illegal by restoring hi business operation (FBO) Registration Certificate bearing Reg.No.22423573001 consequently direct the first and second respondents to remove the lock and made on 23.12.2023 on his shop M/s.Saravanabhava Coffee Bar and Snacks, situ at Shop No.3, Seeman Nagar, Pandikoil Ringh Road, Madurai in accordance with law. For Petitioner : Mr.D.Balamuruga Pandi For R1 & R2 : Mr.A.Kannan Additional Government Pleade For R3 : Mrs.S.Devasena For R4 : Mrs.M.Aasha Government Advocate (Crl.sid ***** ORDER",
